  "evidence": {
    "left_web_and_bar": "Registered IMG_2750, IMG_2759, IMG_2765, IMG_2774\u20132777, v_10647, v_10752, v_10841 and v_12766. Outline and cutouts traced in rectified coordinates; some rims hidden by the bar.",
    "right_web_and_bar": "Registered IMG_2756, IMG_2758\u20132759, IMG_2786, v_12240 and IMG_2821 locally placed on ten inner-face outer-plate hole rims. IMG_2819\u20132821 confirm joins and two rounded triangles.",
    "model_choices": "Web planes and visible anchors are modeled per side; smoother outline edges follow rectified photo picks. Thickness and corner radii are nominal. The hood-off picture establishes a lower hanger opening, a large middle opening and a pierced upper gusset as one continuous plate. The oval is approximated by an ellipse, and the rear perimeter behind the intercooler, left mid-height contours, bend treatment, and hardware interfaces are inferred. The visible chute fasteners belong to the cooler support assembly and are excluded here.",
    "hangers": "The continuous longitudinal rise and its large oval appear in the Oct 18 hood-off reference. Car-right X/Z contours were traced from that image on an approximate hanger plane after image resection. The car-left mid-height profile and oval follow the car-right shape, with car-left November endpoints and openings used locally. November IMG_2750, IMG_2759, IMG_2820, v_10752, v_10841 and v_12240 constrain the lower brace-end connection. Both upper triangular openings and the upper edge landmarks use November multi-view geometry in cooler_supports_v4_measurements.json.",
    "lower_mount_interface": "A nominal rear relief is cut from the hidden hanger edge against the independently modeled lower green rail, lug and fastener. The relief gives line-to-line CAD contact without occupying the same volume. The concealed physical seam, fastener clearance and weld treatment still lack direct views.",
    "rear_radiator_interface": "Inferred aft hanger contour below the cradle constrained ahead of the surveyed rear fin plane. Up to ~7 mm adjustment; hidden front contour below the measured upper gusset toe is tapered behind the photographed shelf corner. See grid/first_assembly_fit_v4.json for superseded assumptions."
  },
  "cooler_support_reference": "grid/cooler_supports_v4_measurements.json"
